    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"#setProperty(java.lang.String,java.lang.Object)\"><code>setProperty(String, Object)</code></a> and <a href=\"#withProperty(java.lang.String,java.lang.Object)\"><code>withProperty(String, Object)</code></a> methods are exposed for\nconvenience, for example:",
